{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616792",
      "title": "Creating Dynamic Pages (with Parameters)",
      "sourceHash": "4b82e479a78ab54b4386118e22464248d0e841dcbdcd76174c4fb86da31bf1fd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 5.17,
          "en": "Creating the detail page like this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.17,
          "end": 7.84,
          "en": "until we realize that we probably would have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.84,
          "end": 11.7,
          "en": "more than one news item on our news site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.7,
          "end": 14.66,
          "en": "It would be very realistic that index.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.66,
          "end": 18.79,
          "en": "and the news folder should output a list of news items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.79,
          "end": 21.17,
          "en": "And then we can click those individual items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.17,
          "end": 23.41,
          "en": "and then take into the detailed pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.41,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "with the concrete content for the news item we selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "So we use the same page over and over again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 34.92,
          "en": "for different news items for different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.92,
          "end": 38.44,
          "en": "We would probably fetch the concrete content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.44,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "from some database when a user visits this detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 43.69,
          "en": "and then display it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.69,
          "end": 46.22,
          "en": "So, it's the same component technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.22,
          "end": 48.34,
          "en": "but with different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.34,
          "end": 50.62,
          "en": "And that's of course a totally realistic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.62,
          "end": 53.58,
          "en": "I would even say very common scenario.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.58,
          "end": 56.66,
          "en": "So hard coding, the identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.66,
          "end": 58.27,
          "en": "like something dash important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.27,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "like this in the file name is not very realistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 65.23,
          "en": "Instead, we wanna create a so-called dynamic page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.23,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "where the path segment to concrete value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "in the path can be dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 72.68,
          "en": "so that it's not just slash news,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.68,
          "end": 74.5,
          "en": "slash something important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.5,
          "end": 76.57,
          "en": "but also slash something else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.57,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "or slash this course is great, whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.43,
          "end": 85.82,
          "en": "So then this would be the identifier of a news item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.82,
          "end": 87.98,
          "en": "and we have a lot of different identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.98,
          "end": 90.7,
          "en": "and we add new use all the time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 92.28,
          "en": "but we always load the same page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 95.11,
          "en": "no matter what the concrete value here is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.11,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "But then inside of the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 99.18,
          "en": "we simply have access to that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.18,
          "end": 102.60300000000001,
          "en": "in the path so that we can fetch the proper data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.52000000000001,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "And that is something we can implement with dynamic paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.737,
          "en": "For that, we change the file name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.737,
          "end": 113.74000000000001,
          "en": "to a different file name, and we use a special syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.74000000000001,
          "end": 116.8,
          "en": "which will be understood by nextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.8,
          "end": 118.68,
          "en": "We use square brackets here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.68,
          "end": 121.053,
          "en": "in the file name in front of the extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.06,
          "end": 125.04,
          "en": "If you have square brackets in your file name like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 129.37,
          "en": "this tells nextJS that this will be a dynamic page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.37,
          "end": 130.85,
          "en": "so that it should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.85,
          "end": 134.89,
          "en": "for different values in your path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.89,
          "end": 137.56,
          "en": "And then you can add an identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.56,
          "end": 139.16,
          "en": "between those square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.16,
          "end": 141.85,
          "en": "where the identifier name is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.85,
          "end": 145.24,
          "en": "Something like newsId, for example, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.24,
          "end": 147.2,
          "en": "But this again is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.2,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "but you need those square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 151.81,
          "en": "This then tells nextJS that this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.81,
          "end": 154.1,
          "en": "will be loaded for different values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.1,
          "end": 157.86,
          "en": "So for example, for something important after slash news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.86,
          "end": 160.84,
          "en": "but also for any other identifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.84,
          "end": 162.3,
          "en": "And then in a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 164.63,
          "en": "I will show you how you can get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.63,
          "end": 168.13,
          "en": "to the concrete value entered here and how you can use that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.13,
          "end": 170.25,
          "en": "But let's get there step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.25,
          "end": 173.65,
          "en": "If we now saved as again, if I load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.65,
          "end": 176.53,
          "en": "for /news/thiscourseisgreat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.53,
          "end": 178.28,
          "en": "I see the detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.28,
          "end": 181.03,
          "en": "but I also see for something else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 185.62,
          "en": "or anything else we enter after slash news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.62,
          "end": 189.12,
          "en": "So that is how we can add such a dynamic path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.12,
          "end": 193.07,
          "en": "And that is another key feature of nextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.07,
          "end": 196.17000000000002,
          "en": "It's a feature that allows us to build truly dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.17000000000002,
          "end": 199.902,
          "en": "and flexible websites with nextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.902,
          "end": 204.902,
          "en": "But how can we now extract the entered path value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.07999999999998,
          "end": 207.68,
          "en": "inside of the component so that we can,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 207.68,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "for example, then fetch the correct news item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 211.64,
          "en": "from a database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.64,
          "end": 214.453,
          "en": "let's say when a user visits this page?",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}